msgid ""
"Support for PostgreSQL v11 and v12 have been removed. The new minimum "
"PostgreSQL version is v13+. See the :ref:`minimum supported PostgreSQL "
"version policy <deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements:minimum "
"postgresql database support policy>` documentation for details."
